                                            "message": "<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; padding-left: 16px;\">\n<li>Set a date and time for the upgrade that fits within your organization's schedule, avoiding peak usage times and critical development periods.</li>\n<li>Review Usage Patterns and analyze historical usage data to identify periods of low activity, suggesting optimal times for the upgrade.</li>\n<li>Coordinate with Stakeholders and ensure all relevant parties are informed and in agreement with the scheduled time.</li>\n</ul>"
